WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.833
- Ready.
- Sí.

00:00:00.916 --> 00:00:01.750
Okay.

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:04.958
Once every four years,

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:09.000
the pursuit of football's grandest prize

00:00:10.291 --> 00:00:12.000
for its grandest players.

00:00:13.125 --> 00:00:15.458
What each intends to be

00:00:16.375 --> 00:00:18.583
his journey of a lifetime.

00:00:19.583 --> 00:00:21.041
Pressure?

00:00:22.500 --> 00:00:24.083
Every player here feels pressure.

00:00:24.166 --> 00:00:26.666
But this is a World Cup,
and it's really tough.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Every country has their stories.

00:00:30.083 --> 00:00:31.708
Every player has their own narrative.

00:00:41.500 --> 00:00:43.166
Everybody wants to win.

00:00:43.750 --> 00:00:45.791
Only one of us will be happy
at the end.

00:00:47.625 --> 00:00:49.416
Let's go win! Come on!

00:00:49.500 --> 00:00:50.541
Let's go, boys!

00:00:53.833 --> 00:00:56.375
I think it's important
that you control your emotions.

00:00:59.333 --> 00:01:00.833
They're under enormous pressure.

00:01:05.875 --> 00:01:08.166
When you have such a person,

00:01:08.250 --> 00:01:11.291
everything is easier
when you step on the pitch.

00:01:11.375 --> 00:01:15.125
What brings us together
in the end is Morocco.

00:01:15.208 --> 00:01:18.208
He tells me, "Daddy,
there's something positive in this."

00:01:18.291 --> 00:01:20.083
"What is that?"
"You're coming home."

00:01:21.125 --> 00:01:24.083
Be ready to fight
in every second of the game.

00:01:33.166 --> 00:01:36.916
Messi, goal!

00:01:37.875 --> 00:01:39.250
This is the World Cup!

00:01:41.208 --> 00:01:42.916
It's life or death.

00:01:45.541 --> 00:01:49.000
Our planet unites
around its ultimate game.

00:01:56.125 --> 00:01:57.958
We're going to fight.

00:02:02.375 --> 00:02:03.916
- Netflix?
- Yes.

00:02:04.000 --> 00:02:06.583
- I'm going to appear on Netflix, then?
- Yes.

00:02:06.666 --> 00:02:09.208
You should have told me.
I'd have dressed better.

